---
layout: base.njk
title: "Guides"
description: "All Social Casino Index research, benchmarks and operator guides in one place."
permalink: "/guides/"
publishedAt: "2026-09-09"
updatedAt: "2026-09-09"
---

<main>
<div class="wrap py-10">
  <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <ol>
      <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
      <li><span aria-current="page">Guides</span></li>
    </ol>
  </nav>

  <h1 class="mb-3 mt-0 font-serif text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight text-base-content sm:text-[2.8rem]">Guides &amp; research</h1>
  <p class="lede mb-10">Benchmarks, payout research and operator guides. Every piece is dated, sourced, and labeled with what we have and have not verified.</p>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
    {% for item in collections.guides | sortByDateDesc %}
    <a href="{{ item.url }}" class="card group no-underline transition hover:border-brand">
      <div class="card-head">
        <span class="badge {% if item.data.guideType == 'Benchmark' %}complete{% else %}pending{% endif %}">{{ item.data.guideType or "Article" }}</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3 !text-xl group-hover:text-brand">{{ item.data.title }}</h2>
        <p>{{ item.data.description }}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card-foot">
        <p><i class="ph ph-calendar-blank" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{ item.data.publishedAt | readableDate }}{% if item.data.updatedAt and item.data.updatedAt != item.data.publishedAt %} · Updated {{ item.data.updatedAt | readableDate }}{% endif %}</p>
        <p class="text-brand">Read <i class="ph ph-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></p>
      </div>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>
</main>
